        {
            "title": "〈熱門股〉健策三片式均熱片明年量產 周漲逾3成",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">散熱廠健策(3653-TW)指出，目前訂單能見度達6個月，三片式均熱片將於明年量產，可望帶動毛利表現，明年展望正面，並預期未來多數客戶有望採用，激勵健策本周大漲逾3成，站上年線。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">健策本周漲31.58%，周五(27日)一度站回5000元關卡，最高漲至5040元，終場收4885元，本周同步收復5日線、半年線以及年線。本周三大法人連續3個交易日買超，合計買超184張。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">隨著AI散熱產品需求提升，健策今年前三季散熱產品營收比重達76%，公司指出，目前訂單能見度達6個月，新一代三片式均熱片將於明年量產，並預期將不只一家客戶採用，展望正向。</p><div class=\"bg-toast-background -mx-5 -mt-2 mb-3 pb-3 md:-mx-0 lg:mx-auto lg:w-[300px] lg:pb-0\"><div class=\"text-px14 text-gandalf py-1 text-center leading-5\">廣告</div><div class=\"mx-auto text-center min-w-[300px] min-h-[250px]\" id=\"sda-inbody-f27b1f6a-ba60-3301-bf05-eefc6233b3b3-1-iframe\"><div class=\"bg-dirty-seagull text-px12 text-dolphin mx-auto hidden items-center justify-center only:flex w-[300px] h-[250px]\">廣告</div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">產能布局上，健策表示，大園一廠已於第三季擴建完成，大園三廠則預計明年完工投產。</p><div class=\"recommendation-contents\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mb-2 h-[30px] w-[80px] rounded-lg\"></div><div class=\"no-scrollbar -mx-5 mb-5 flex overflow-hidden overflow-x-auto md:-mx-2 lg:mb-3.5\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mr-2 ml-5 h-[94px] w-[calc(85%-28px)] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg md:ml-2 md:w-[calc(85%-16px)] lg:w-[300px]\"></div><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mx-2 h-[94px] w-[85%] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg lg:w-[300px]\"></div><div class=\"bg-marshmallow hidden h-[94px] w-[300px] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg lg:block\"></div></div></div><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"rounded-lg\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"1034\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/a